<%- include('partials/header') %>
<div class="panel" style="max-width:760px;margin:30px auto">
  <h1>How it works</h1>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li><b>Pick an item.</b> Each item (for example a cow worth ₦1,500,000) is split into a fixed number of equal shares (for example 30 shares of ₦50,000).</li>
    <li><b>Reserve your share.</b> Choose how many shares you want, and whether you will collect at the market on sharing day or want delivery to your address.</li>
    <li><b>Pay.</b> Pay instantly with OPay, or by direct bank transfer and upload your receipt. Your share is held for you while you pay.</li>
    <li><b>Watch it fill up.</b> Every item page shows how many people have paid and how many shares are left. When all shares are paid, entry closes automatically.</li>
    <li><b>Sharing day.</b> Come to the sharing point in Owerri with your order reference, or receive your share at your location.</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="muted small">If an item is cancelled, or your payment arrives after all shares are taken, you get a full refund.</p>
  <a class="btn" href="/">See open items</a>
</div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
